.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python bytecode, if you end up with helper scripts
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Screen recordings and video — too large for GitHub's 100MB file limit,
# and screen captures of a school portal can contain exactly the things
# this folder must never hold (student IDs, addresses, credentials).
# Keep them outside the repo.
*.mov
*.mp4

# Scanned paperwork often carries identity documents. If you need to keep
# a PDF, read it first and confirm what's on every page.
# *.pdf
